// The same route through `std/net`, so the rule is the gate table's and not a
// special case for `std/process`: `Listener.port()` reads `local_port_raw` on
// whatever descriptor the module wrote, and `net.Listener` is a public `datac`
// whose `fd` anyone can forge.
impl "util"

fun main() {
    print(util.probe())
}
